name: "shopsystem"

displayName: "Shop System"

author: "[#00D4FF[]]SamielXD[[]]"

description:
  '''
[accent[]]ShopSystemMod v1.3 - Your Personal In-Game Economy![[]]

[white[]]🎮 NEW: Press K key or type /shop to access the shop on PC! Mobile users tap the SHOP button![[]]

[yellow[]]⚠️ MAJOR UPDATE v1.3: Full Erekir Support, PC Compatibility, Pet Evolution, and tons of new features![[]]

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[gold[]]📋 CHANGELOG - What's New in v1.3:[[]]

[cyan[]]🎮 PC & Mobile Support:[[]]
  • Press K key to open shop instantly (PC)
  • Type /shop in chat to access shop
  • Touch-optimized UI for mobile
  • Works seamlessly on both platforms!

[lime[]]🪐 Full Erekir Support:[[]]
  • 4 Erekir Resources: Beryllium, Tungsten, Oxide, Carbide
  • 3 Erekir Units: Stell, Locus, Merui
  • Separate Serpulo and Erekir categories
  • Auto planet detection
  • Resource Converter for cross-planet trading

[white[]]🐾 Pet System Overhaul:[[]]
  • Real animal names: Cat, Dog, Eagle, Fox, Bear, Panther, etc.
  • Pet Evolution System - Upgrade pets to stronger versions!
  • Cat → Lion, Dog → Wolf, Eagle → Phoenix
  • 9 NEW pets added (13 total now!)
  • Erekir Pets: Cobra, Hawk, Tiger
  • Max income: 369 coins/min (up from 164!)

[cyan[]]✨ New Features:[[]]
  • Pet Missions - Send pets for guaranteed rewards (4 types)
  • Daily Challenges - 4 challenges, 80-120 coins each
  • Milestone Rewards - 6 tiers, up to 3000 coins
  • Crafting System - Craft Surge Alloy, Phase Fabric, Plastanium
  • Resource Converter - Convert Serpulo ↔ Erekir resources
  • Better UI with organized categories

[white[]]🏆 New Rewards:[[]]
  • 3 New Achievements
  • 6 Milestone Rewards
  • 4 Pet Mission Types
  • New Redeem Codes

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[lime[]]💰 What's This All About?[[]]

Earn coins by playing the game - killing enemies, completing waves, doing daily tasks. Spend those coins in the shop to buy resources, spawn units, or use special abilities. Now with full support for both Serpulo and Erekir!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[cyan[]]🛒 The Shop Has:[[]]

[white[]]Serpulo Resources[[]] → Copper, Lead, Coal, Titanium, Thorium
[white[]]Erekir Resources[[]] → Beryllium, Tungsten, Oxide, Carbide
[white[]]Serpulo Units[[]] → Flare, Dagger, Mace squads
[white[]]Erekir Units[[]] → Stell, Locus, Merui squads
[white[]]Boosts[[]] → Skip waves or heal all buildings
[white[]]Pets[[]] → 13 pets with evolution system
[white[]]Pet Missions[[]] → Send pets for guaranteed rewards
[white[]]Auction House[[]] → Bid on exclusive items
[white[]]Converter[[]] → Exchange Serpulo ↔ Erekir resources
[white[]]Crafting[[]] → Craft advanced materials
[white[]]Favorites[[]] → Star your favorite items

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[gold[]]⭐ VIP System[[]]

The more you spend, the more VIP EXP you get. Level up your VIP status and earn coins way faster. At max level (VIP 5), you get 6x coins and 25% discount on everything!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[lime[]]🎮 How Do I Use This?[[]]

[cyan[]]PC:[[]]
1. Press K key anywhere
2. Type /shop in chat
3. Click Shop button in pause menu

[cyan[]]Mobile:[[]]
1. Tap the SHOP [K] button on the right side of your screen

Your coins, VIP level, and Shop level are always shown in the UI!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[cyan[]]📈 Ways to Earn Coins:[[]]

[white[]]Playing the game:[[]]
  • Each enemy killed = 1 coin (× VIP level)
  • Each wave completed = 5 coins (× VIP level)

[white[]]Daily stuff:[[]]
  • Daily Quests → 15-25 coins
  • Daily Challenges → 80-120 coins each (4 challenges)
  • Daily Work → 30-50 coins
  • Daily Login → Up to 150 coins

[white[]]Long-term:[[]]
  • Achievements → 50-300 coins
  • Milestone Rewards → 50-3000 coins
  • Pets → 2-100 coins per minute automatically
  • Pet Missions → 40-450 coins per mission
  • Auction House → Bid smart and win!

[white[]]Secret stuff:[[]]
  • Flash Sales → Up to 50% off random items
  • Redeem Codes → Hidden codes for free coins!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[yellow[]]🐾 Pet System - All 13 Pets with Evolution:[[]]

[cyan[]]Serpulo Pets:[[]]
  [white[]]Cat[[]] → Lion (2 → 30 coins/min) [Wave 3]
  [white[]]Dog[[]] → Wolf (3 → 25 coins/min) [Wave 5]
  [white[]]Eagle[[]] → Phoenix (5 → 40 coins/min) [Wave 10]
  [white[]]Fox[[]] → Kitsune (8 coins/min) [Wave 15]
  [white[]]Bear[[]] → Grizzly (12 coins/min) [Wave 20]
  [white[]]Panther[[]] → Jaguar (18 coins/min) [Wave 25]

[gold[]]Erekir Pets:[[]]
  [white[]]Cobra[[]] → Python (15 coins/min) [Wave 22]
  [white[]]Hawk[[]] → Falcon (22 coins/min) [Wave 28]
  [white[]]Tiger[[]] (35 coins/min) [Wave 38]

[accent[]]Legendary:[[]]
  [white[]]Dragon[[]] (100 coins/min) [Wave 60]

[lime[]]Max passive income: 369 coins/min![[]]

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[cyan[]]🚀 Pet Missions - Guaranteed Rewards:[[]]

  [white[]]Scout Mission[[]] → 2 min, 40 coins (Need 1 pet)
  [white[]]Resource Hunt[[]] → 4 min, 90 coins (Need 2 pets)
  [white[]]Treasure Search[[]] → 8 min, 200 coins (Need 3 pets)
  [white[]]Epic Journey[[]] → 15 min, 450 coins (Need 5 pets)

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[gold[]]🏛️ Auction House[[]]

Bid on exclusive high-tier items:
  • Plastanium (50 units)
  • Phase Fabric (30 units)
  • Surge Alloy (20 units)
  • Carbide (40 units) - Erekir exclusive!

Place bids or use "Buy Now" to get items instantly!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[cyan[]]🔄 Resource Converter:[[]]

Exchange resources between planets at fixed rates:
  • Copper ↔ Beryllium (2:1)
  • Lead ↔ Tungsten (3:1)
  • Titanium ↔ Oxide (4:1)

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[gold[]]⚒️ Crafting System:[[]]

Craft advanced materials:
  • Surge Alloy (100 Copper + 100 Lead + 50 Titanium + 200 coins)
  • Phase Fabric (50 Thorium + 80 Titanium + 150 coins)
  • Plastanium (60 Titanium + 40 Coal + 100 coins)

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[white[]]🔒 The Lock System:[[]]

Items unlock based on:
  • Waves completed
  • Shop level

Locked items show exactly what you need to unlock them!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[cyan[]]💡 Pro Tips:[[]]

• Do daily quests and challenges for easy coins
• Complete pet missions for guaranteed rewards
• Save up for pets - they pay for themselves!
• With all 13 pets, earn 369 coins/min passively
• Evolve your pets for even better earnings
• Use the Resource Converter to get planet-specific items
• Craft advanced materials when you have extra resources
• Check the auction house regularly
• Use bulk buying for bonus items!
• Press K on PC for instant shop access!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[red[]]⚠️ Known Issues:[[]]

• Work system might not track progress sometimes (just restart it)
• Spam-clicking can cause weird behavior
• UI might look odd on very small screens
• Pet missions may not update immediately
• Sound effects need sound files in sounds/ folder
• daily login not working properly

Nothing game-breaking!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[lime[]]📊 Current Content (v1.3):[[]]

9 Resources (5 Serpulo + 4 Erekir) • 6 Unit types • 2 Boosts
13 Pets with Evolution • 4 Pet Missions • 4 Auction Items
3 Daily Quests • 4 Daily Challenges • 3 Work Activities
10 Login Rewards • 6 Achievements • 6 Milestone Rewards
15+ Redeem Codes • Flash Sales • VIP Levels 1-5
Auction House • Favorites • Bulk Buying • Resource Converter
Crafting System • PC Keybind (K) • Chat Command (/shop)
Advanced Statistics • 3 Custom Sound Effects

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[cyan[]]🔊 Sound Files Needed:[[]]

Place these in your mod's sounds/ folder:
  • pop.ogg - UI clicks
  • switch.ogg - Menu transitions
  • coins.ogg - Coin sounds

Mod works without them but sounds are better!

[accent[]]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[[]]

[white[]]That's it! Press K (PC) or tap SHOP (Mobile) to start building your economy![[]]

[gray[]]Have fun, Hope you enjoy my mod! 💰[[]]

[white[]]- SamielXD[[]]
  '''

version: "1.3"

minGameVersion: 154

dependencies: []

main: "scripts/main.js"

